WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.340
At the end of prayer, many Muslims offer
a greeting to beings they cannot see.

2
00:00:05.390 --> 00:00:09.430
Muslims believe recording
angels write down every deed.

3
00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:12.920
Angels are one of 6
articles of Muslim faith.

4
00:00:12.970 --> 00:00:15.710
Yet the declaration of
faith, the Shahadah,

5
00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:17.270
never mentions them.

6
00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:22.370
So why would belief in invisible angels
hold up the whole of Muslim faith?

7
00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:25.210
In this mission, you'll
map the six articles,

8
00:00:25.260 --> 00:00:29.030
and see where each one comes from
in the Qur'an and the Hadith.

9
00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:34.150
Then you'll meet three named angels, and
find out which one the Qur'an never names

10
00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.380
at all.

11
00:00:35.430 --> 00:00:40.690
Your mission: explain why belief in unseen
angels could hold up the whole of Muslim

12
00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:41.400
faith.
